"with a live-coding session."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"As was mentioned previously, the base project files (pom.xml, Dockerfiles, .."
".) are already generated by the base codestarts provided by the Quarkus core."
" Thanks to this, we can only focus on the starter code specific to the "
"extension."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Let's take `io.quarkiverse.aloha:quarkus-aloha` as an example extension GAV "
"(don't look for this extension, it doesn't exist)."
